    "sub_name": "金融科技與大數據專題",
    "sub_ename": "SPECIAL TOPICS IN FINANCIAL TECHNOLOGY AND BIG DATA",
    "describe_ch": "隨著資訊科技的發展，傳統的金融領域已經產生很大的變革。本課程將介紹國內外金融科技和大數據的近期發展現況，主題涵蓋新型支付、投資理財、保險科技、區塊鏈應用、人工智慧和數位行銷。",
    "describe_eh": "With the development of information technology, there has been a large transformation in traditional finance. This course will introduce the local and global studies and cases in financial technology and big data. The topics include the new payment system, investment and financial plan, insurance technology, blockchain application, artificial intelligence, and digital marketing.",
